{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "重建版 eval_set：6 類 x 15 = 90 題 + multi_hop x 10 = 100 題（2026-07-29：multi_intent 收斂為嚴格『1 財務指標 + 1 新聞事實』的平行雙意圖；新增 multi_hop 類——hop-2 的查詢關鍵字須待 hop-1 答案才能形成，單管線結構上做不到，作為 Agentic replan 的正當評測靶）。純 RAGAS 架構：reference 由 eval/gen_reference_answers.py 從 relevant 黃金來源撈 chunk 自動生成。",
    "categories": {
      "semantic": "Conceptual / strategic / qualitative queries (10-K Item 1/1A) — dense embedding should excel",
      "lexical": "Specific numbers, tickers, dates, document names (Fundamentals/IncomeStatement/10-K/10-Q) — sparse keyword matching should excel",
      "mixed": "Segment-level concept (growth driver) + concrete lexical anchor (10-Q MD&A) — hybrid retrieval should win",
      "colloquial": "Layperson phrasing avoiding financial jargon; each question maps_to an existing semantic/lexical/mixed/news/multi_intent question sharing its ground truth — tests query-rewrite vocabulary bridging",
      "news": "Answerable ONLY from news (analyst ratings, deals, financings, executive statements, stock moves) — validates doc_type=news hard filter",
      "multi_intent": "Parallel dual-intent: exactly ONE financial figure (Fundamentals/IncomeStatement/10-Q) AND ONE news fact, retrievable independently in parallel — tests single-pass decomposition, NOT multi-hop.",
      "multi_hop": "True multi-hop: answering requires CHAINED retrieval where hop-2's search key is unknowable until hop-1 is resolved (cross-company superlative -> winner's attribute; or news-event -> entity -> financials). Each hop crosses doc_type. Single-pass RAG structurally cannot chain; this is Agentic replan's rightful test bed."
    },
    "ground_truth_syntax": {
      "exact": "Provide the full filename, e.g. 'NVDA_10K_2026.html'",
      "glob": "Use wildcards, e.g. 'NVDA_News_*.txt' matches all NVDA news regardless of date suffix"
    },
    "schema": "Each query: {id, category, query, relevant (source globs), answerable}. colloquial queries add maps_to (id of the question sharing its ground truth).",
    "reference_answers": "Generate via: .venv/Scripts/python.exe eval/gen_reference_answers.py --output eval/reference_answers.json",
    "_2026-08-19 拆分": "KB 拔除新聞語料（見 docs/EVAL.md〈KB 拔除新聞〉）→ 原 100 題有 37 題的 relevant 含 *_News_*.txt，那些題在只有 filing + Fundamentals 的 KB 上結構性無法作答。把它們整批搬到 eval/eval_set_news.json 冷凍，本檔只留 63 題純記錄類問題。⚠ 跨 2026-08-19 的分數不可直接比：題目組成變了，分母不同。",
    "_2026-08-19 補回兩題": "lex-16／lex-17 是從冷凍的 mi-04／mi-05 去掉新聞子句後補回來的（63 → 65 題）。動機不是題數，是**量尺覆蓋**：拆分把 check_number_defects 的主張從 6 條打到 4 條，而搬走的那兩條一 PASS 一 FAIL——留在冷凍檔裡等於整條驗收線少掉兩個訊號。⚠ 這兩題的 relevant 只剩 Fundamentals／IncomeStatement，與新聞無關。"
